kastaneda:
Search queries in the future:
— how to get root on a car ...;
— download firmware for running a flashing green and yellow light;
— enable overtaking on the shoulder;
— permission to turn left from the far right lane;
— etc.

moooV:
And to load new firmware, you'll have to simultaneously press the brake, pull the handbrake and honk.

